    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ehehe. Good morning, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, Doctor looks a little scary right now. Did I do something wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, please don't be mad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hnng... Doctor, that hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you bop me on the head...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like she's back to her senses, at least.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kay, do you remember how you got here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Umm... I forgot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come lie down, I'll check and see if there's anything wrong with you. Don't run off again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay~ Ehh, where are we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're... Hm, it's a long story. Just lie down already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_2013_cerber_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
