    {
        "text": "Are you done?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So now can you tell me what the hell you're doing, Gavial?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*, I said it's a long story. Short version is I'm here to look for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not getting the engine back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That too. But there's another reason I'm looking for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Another reason?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you have your people mining ore?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Tch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
