        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, I never took you for the sore loser type.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you that broken up about being beaten by the Big, Ugly Thing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, your Big Ugly Whatever is great. I'm totally fine with that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you're putting your people at risk of Oripathy infection for the sake of some ore, then as a doctor I have no choice but to stop you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Oripathy? Oh, you're talking about Stone Disease.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not putting anyone at risk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I told them many times to stay away from the depths of the mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But your people are getting infected!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's always someone who doesn't listen. I can't control them all. Isn't that right, Yogi?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_070",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, my brother wanted to dig out more ore for the Great Chief, so he went deeper into the mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yogi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Why didn't you say so earlier?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You didn't ask.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yogi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_070",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "That's pretty important...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You told me they don't take Oripathy seriously here.;.......;You really didn't ask.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Agh, fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, did I really not ask?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Agh, Doctor, take my side here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, why are you taking your clothes off?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Your body...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been running around the mine ever since I was a kid. It's only natural I would get the Stone Disease.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I dare say no one knows better than me where the diseased rocks are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "My mistake. Sorry for accusing you, Zumama.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, that's all it took?! We're all good now?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't everybody supposed to stubbornly stick to their guns until we all end up in one big honkin' battle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ya shouldn't hope fer stuff like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Gavial isn't like that.;......;Too bad.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then let's talk about the other thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have our engine, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you return that to us? We can't leave without it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to leave, I can have someone escort you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No good. Kal'tsit will get mad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't hand it over no matter what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, looks like we're gonna fight after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That was the plan from the very beginning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
