    {
        "text": "Oh, are we fighting that? Fun!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, nice to meet you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...High Priest, why did you bring the Big Ugly out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Aren't we going to fight Gavial? Do we not need it? If not, I'll drive it back. I still want to test the engine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We need it, but not now. I still have something to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, alright. You have your talk first then. Call me when you want to fight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, what was that about an engine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, your engine is powering the Big Ugly right now. If you want it, you'll have to fight for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe. Deal!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me. We'll see who comes out on top.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
